      "writtenOn": "2017-10-05T16:56:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am not sure what you mean by stack corruption here. If the code were to write into memory beyond this structure boundaries - would in to be just as bad if the structure was in .bss? Or are you talking about stack overflow which I don\u0027t think is a problem here?\n\nI just feel like we should be saving as much room in  SRAM as we can.",
